// dsh-mini-skin — a stylesheet-only DSH skin.
//
// What it does: injects ONE <style> tag (colour tokens + an optional background
// image layer) and sets one attribute on <body> so the stylesheet is scoped and
// switchable. Nothing else.
//
// What it deliberately does NOT do: no MutationObserver, no DOM decoration, no
// icon redrawing, no layout changes, no node-half static route. Runtime cost is
// one style recalculation when the page loads, and nothing per keystroke, per
// streamed token or per scroll event.
//
