// refresh the page. There is no build step — this file is the artifact.
//
// Artwork note: the embedded scene images come from the dsh-deep-whale project
// (ORCA LINK, by Small-tailqwq, derived from 上善's whale-girl character). They
// are CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — attribution required, non-commercial only, share-alike.
// See artwork/NOTICE and artwork/LICENSE-ARTWORK next to this package.

